<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Paleta Mocha & Cream - Pro</title>
  
  <!-- Importación de fuentes tipográficas premium -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-app: #FAF7F5;
      --mocha-dark: #4A3B32;
      --mocha-medium: #78665B;
      --cream-accent: #C8B2A1;
      --cream-soft: #F2ECE7;
      --white-pure: #FFFFFF;
      --border-color: #EFEAE6;
      --green-ready: #2E7D32;
      --green-bg: #E8F5E9;
      --orange-prep: #E65100;
      --orange-bg: #FFF3E0;
    }

    body { 
      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; 
      background: var(--bg-app); 
      color: var(--mocha-dark);
      padding: 40px 20px; 
      display: flex; 
      justify-content: center; 
      margin: 0;
    }

    .card { 
      background: var(--white-pure); 
      padding: 28px; 
      border-radius: 20px; 
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(74, 59, 50, 0.05); 
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      max-width: 440px; 
      width: 100%; 
    }

    .header {
      background: var(--mocha-dark);
      color: var(--white-pure);
      padding: 18px 24px;
      border-radius: 14px 14px 0 0;
      margin: -28px -28px 24px -28px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .header-title {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    }

    .header-tag {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); 
      padding: 4px 10px; 
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    h3 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 22px;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--mocha-medium);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .grid { 
      display: grid; 
      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); 
      gap: 10px; 
      margin: 20px 0; 
    }

    .swatch { 
      height: 50px; 
      border-radius: 8px; 
      transition: transform 0.2s;
    }

    .swatch:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .info { 
      font-size: 10px; 
      font-weight: 700; 
      text-align: center; 
      margin-top: 6px; 
      color: var(--mocha-medium);
    }

    /* Componentes con Animación y Efectos */
    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--mocha-dark);
      color: var(--white-pure);
      border: none;
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 14px;
      cursor: pointer;
      width: 100%;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(74, 59, 50, 0.15);
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: #3B2E27;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: var(--cream-soft);
      color: var(--mocha-dark);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 14px;
      cursor: pointer;
      width: 100%;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: #E8DFD7;
    }

    .status-badge {
      padding: 8px 14px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .status-badge.ready {
      background: var(--green-bg);
      color: var(--green-ready);
    }

    .status-badge.prep {
      background: var(--orange-bg);
      color: var(--orange-prep);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="header">
      <span class="header-title">☕ Campus Specialty Coffee</span>
      <span class="header-tag">MOCHA UI</span>
    </div>

    <h3>Estilo Mocha & Cream</h3>
    <p>Paleta optimizada con tipografía <strong>Playfair Display</strong> y <strong>Plus Jakarta Sans</strong> para darle elegancia a tu app.</p>
    
    <div class="grid">
      <div><div class="swatch" style="background: #4A3B32;"></div><div class="info">#4A3B32</div></div>
      <div><div class="swatch" style="background: #C8B2A1;"></div><div class="info">#C8B2A1</div></div>
      <div><div class="swatch" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #ddd;"></div><div class="info">#FFFFFF</div></div>
      <div><div class="swatch" style="background: #388E3C;"></div><div class="info">#388E3C</div></div>
      <div><div class="swatch" style="background: #F57C00;"></div><div class="info">#F57C00</div></div>
    </div>

    <hr style="border:0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); margin: 24px 0;">

    <button class="btn-primary">Ordenar Capuchino ($3.500)</button>
    <button class="btn-secondary">Agregar al Carrito</button>

    <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px; justify-content: center; margin-top: 20px;">
      <span class="status-badge ready">● Listo para Retirar</span>
      <span class="status-badge prep">● En Preparación</span>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
